sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client Browser
    participant API as GameApiController
    participant ACP as AsyncCommandProcessor
    participant GSM as GameStateMachine
    participant SN as SignalRNotificationService
    participant SH as SignalR Hub
    participant AC as All Clients

    Note over C,AC: Async Command Processing Flow
    
    C->>+API: POST /api/game/action<br/>{gameId, playerId, messageType, data}
    Note right of C: Fire-and-forget command
    
    API->>API: Generate commandId
    API->>API: Validate request & game exists
    
    API->>+ACP: ProcessAsync(request, commandId)
    Note right of API: Fire-and-forget processing
    
    API-->>-C: Immediate Response<br/>{success: true, commandId, estimatedCompletionMs: 100}
    Note left of API: Client gets instant acknowledgment
    
    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over ACP,AC: Async Processing (Parallel)
        
        ACP->>+GSM: Process game logic
        Note right of ACP: Execute command on GameStateMachine
        
        GSM->>GSM: HandleDoAction/HandlePurchase/etc.
        GSM->>GSM: Update game state
        GSM-->>-ACP: Return updated GameModel
        
        par Parallel Notifications
            ACP->>+SN: NotifyAsync(gameId, gameModel)
            SN->>+SH: SendAsync("GameStateUpdated", gameModel)
            SH->>AC: Push to all clients in game group
            SH-->>-SN: Complete
            SN-->>-ACP: Notification sent
        and
            ACP->>+SN: NotifyCommandCompletedAsync(gameId, commandId, true)
            SN->>+SH: SendAsync("CommandCompleted", commandId, success, message)
            SH->>C: Command completion notification
            SH-->>-SN: Complete
            SN-->>-ACP: Command completion sent
        end
        
        ACP->>ACP: Process complete
    end
    
    Note over C,AC: All clients receive real-time updates<br/>Original client gets command completion